/.output

# Only build output is ignored. Never list a program's *name* here.
#
# An earlier version ignored /process, /stdiocap and /browsertrace as build
# artifacts. Build output later moved to .output/ (Makefile: OUTPUT := .output),
# so those rules stopped matching artifacts and started matching the *source
# directories* of the same name — silently keeping three eBPF programs out of
# version control. collector/src/framework/binary_extractor.rs include_bytes!-
# embeds .output/bin/{process,tls_capture,stdiocap}, so a fresh clone could not
# build at all. Do not re-add them; ignore .output, not program names.
